  "definition": "Waivers",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-12-06",
  "historyNote": "#9899-A, eff 3-29-11 (from He-P 813.10); ss by #12740, INTERIM, eff 3-20-19, EXPIRED: 9-16-19 New. #12934, eff 12-6-19",
